---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { process } from '../data/content';
import '../styles/pages.css';
const principles = [
  { name: 'Design with a reason.', text: 'The right visual choice should help someone understand, recognize, or use the business. Character matters. So does a clear route through it.' },
  { name: 'Make the practical part work.', text: 'A polished page and a useful system are not opposing goals. We connect the design to the customer action or everyday task it is meant to support.' },
  { name: 'Say what is included.', text: 'Clear scope makes better decisions possible. Deliverables, costs, dependencies, and responsibilities need to be understandable before work begins.' },
  { name: 'Choose appropriate complexity.', text: 'More technology is not automatically more value. The solution should fit the resources and people available to use and maintain it.' },
  { name: 'Keep the claims honest.', text: 'An ambition is not a result. A concept is not client work. We distinguish what is confirmed from what is possible, including in our own website.' },
];
---
<Base title="About" description="Reachly pairs thoughtful design and practical systems for Indonesian SMEs and entrepreneurs. Explore our focus, principles, and intended process.">
  <section class="shell page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">Reachly Studio / Our approach</p><h1 class="display page-title">Thoughtful by design.<br /><em>Useful by intention.</em></h1><div class="intro-tail"><span class="signal-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><p class="lede">Reachly helps Indonesian small and medium-sized businesses build a professional digital presence and make their tools work more coherently together.</p></div></section>
  <section class="about-statement"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">What we believe</p><h2 class="display">A business should not have to choose between <em>looking considered</em> and <em>working clearly.</em></h2></div></section>
  <section class="shell section-space split-editorial"><div><p class="eyebrow">A coordinated approach</p><h2 class="display">The page.<br />The presence.<br /><em>The practical part.</em></h2></div><div class="reading"><p class="lede">Websites, visibility, strategy, and automation are parts of the same business experience.</p><p>For a new business, that may mean a credible first website and a clear way to inquire. For an established one, it may mean bringing scattered information together or making a repetitive handoff less fragile. We start with the change you want to make, then choose the work around it.</p><p>Our focus is Indonesian SMEs and entrepreneurs. The aim is a digital foundation that is understandable, appropriate to the business, and possible to sustain—not complexity for its own sake.</p><a class="text-link" href="/services">Explore the five service areas <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
  <section class="shell principles section-space" aria-labelledby="principles-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">How we make decisions</p><h2 class="display" id="principles-title">Principles,<br /><em>not superlatives.</em></h2></div><ol>{principles.map((principle, index) => <li><span class="folio">0{index + 1}</span><div><h3>{principle.name}</h3><p>{principle.text}</p></div></li>)}</ol></section>
  <section class="scope-band"><div class="shell process-strip"><p class="eyebrow">The intended journey</p><h2 class="display">A clear way of working.</h2><ol>{process.map(stage => <li><h3>{stage.name}</h3><p>{stage.text}</p></li>)}</ol><p class="process-note">The steps describe our approach. The timing, reviews, handover, and further support depend on the agreed engagement.</p></div></section>
  <section class="shell section-space split-editorial"><div><p class="eyebrow">Room for exploration</p><h2 class="display">One identity.<br /><em>Two ways in.</em></h2></div><div class="reading"><p class="lede">Studio makes the business and the work clear. Possibilities explores what an idea can become.</p><p>Our interactive exhibition is an authored demonstration of design and technical craft. Its workflow examples are illustrative, not live business systems. It is a place to explore—without suggesting every business website needs the same treatment.</p><a class="text-link" href="/possibilities">Enter Reachly Possibilities <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="honesty-note"><h3>Services now. Products as a future direction.</h3><p>Reusable software is a planned direction, informed by recurring business needs. It is not a launched Reachly product, platform, or subscription offer.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="closing-panel"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Start where you are</p><h2 class="display">Make room for<br />your next idea.</h2><a class="button button--dark" href="/contact">Prepare your project brief <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section>
</Base>
